{"id":"a2a90838812e19d9","group":"90","path":"90/90-thm-fixed-point-algorithm.md","title":"Fixed Point Algorithm","display":"thm-fixed-point-algorithm — Fixed Point Algorithm","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-thm-fixed-point-algorithm","aliases":["90-thm-fixed-point-algorithm"],"display":"thm-fixed-point-algorithm — Fixed Point Algorithm","depends_on":["[[90-df-provable]]","[[90-df-fixed-point-theorem]]","[[90-df-substitution-function]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-thm-fixed-point-algorithm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-thm-fixed-point-algorithm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fixed-point-algorithm — Fixed Point Algorithm"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"00ee901093c12d44\" href=\"?note=00ee901093c12d44\" title=\"90-df-provable\">90-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adc0aa731119457e\" href=\"?note=adc0aa731119457e\" title=\"90-df-fixed-point-theorem\">90-df-fixed-point-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g,d,T\">\\(S,g,d,T\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\)</span>，并固定其中一个表示公式见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vartheta\">\\(\\vartheta\\)</span>。编码、语法树算法及替换函数均使用同一环境。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 为本次调用的指定变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Code}^{(1)}_S,\\operatorname{CodeSent}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Code}^{(1)}_S,\\operatorname{CodeSent}_S\\)</span> 在下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 的类型化公式应用取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a>，不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 返回的带标签表达式直接当作公式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fix}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fix}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Code}^{(1)}_S\\coloneqq g[\\mathrm{Fml}^{(1)}_S[\\langle v\\rangle]],\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CodeSent}_S\\coloneqq g[\\mathrm{Sent}_S].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Code}^{(1)}_S\\coloneqq g[\\mathrm{Fml}^{(1)}_S[\\langle v\\rangle]],\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CodeSent}_S\\coloneqq g[\\mathrm{Sent}_S].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathrm{Fix}_S\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\ \\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\Bigl[\n&amp;(e\\notin\\operatorname{Code}^{(1)}_S\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Fix}_S(e)=0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl(e\\in\\operatorname{Code}^{(1)}_S\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Fix}_S(e)\\in\\operatorname{CodeSent}_S\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists\\phi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{(1)}_S\\ \\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\\n[e=g(\\phi)\\land\\mathrm{Fix}_S(e)=g(\\psi)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18em}\\land T\\vdash(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\phi[\\overline{\\mathrm{Fix}_S(e)}/v])]\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathrm{Fix}_S\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\ \\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\Bigl[\n&amp;(e\\notin\\operatorname{Code}^{(1)}_S\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Fix}_S(e)=0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl(e\\in\\operatorname{Code}^{(1)}_S\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Fix}_S(e)\\in\\operatorname{CodeSent}_S\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists\\phi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{(1)}_S\\ \\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\\n[e=g(\\phi)\\land\\mathrm{Fix}_S(e)=g(\\psi)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18em}\\land T\\vdash(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\phi[\\overline{\\mathrm{Fix}_S(e)}/v])]\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>对合法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，唯一的单自由变量公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi(v)\">\\(\\phi(v)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=g(\\phi)\">\\(e=g(\\phi)\\)</span>。有效解码后取公式分量，即可机械构造 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a> 证明中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_\\phi(v)\">\\(\\delta_\\phi(v)\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_e=g(\\delta_\\phi)\">\\(b_e=g(\\delta_\\phi)\\)</span>，并置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fix}_S(e)=\\mathrm{Sub}_S(b_e,b_e)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fix}_S(e)=\\mathrm{Sub}_S(b_e,b_e)\\)</span>；非法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 置零。合法码集可判定，解码、类型投影、公式构造与新鲜变量算法均有效，所以该函数全可计算。所引构造给出断言中的句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 和可证等价式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原一元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fix}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fix}_S\\)</span> 与非法输入返回零的接口。结论只断言给定一个满足条件的环境后存在算法，不声称能判定任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,g\">\\(T,g\\)</span> 是否充分，也不声称能从充分性断言自动搜索到其表示公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"00ee901093c12d44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-fixed-point-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"adc0aa731119457e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-fixed-point-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"7279c20158ac140e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,g,d,T$ 满足 [[90-df-diagonal-lemma]] 的 $\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)$，并固定其中一个表示公式见证 $\\vartheta$。编码、语法树算法及替换函数均使用同一环境。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$v$ 为本次调用的指定变量，$\\operatorname{Code}^{(1)}_S,\\operatorname{CodeSent}_S$ 在下式定义；$g$ 的类型化公式应用取 [[90-df-formula]]，不把 $d$ 返回的带标签表达式直接当作公式。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Proof]","excerpt":"对合法 $e$，唯一的单自由变量公式 $\\phi(v)$ 满足 $e=g(\\phi)$。有效解码后取公式分量，即可机械构造 [[90-df-diagonal-lemma]] 证明中的 $\\delta_\\phi(v)$。令 $b_e=g(\\delta_\\phi)$，并置 $\\mathrm{Fix}_S(e)=\\mathrm{Sub}_S(b_e,b_e)$；非法 $e$ 置零。合法码集可判定，解码、类型投影、公式构造与新鲜变量算法均有效，所以该函数全可计算。所引构造给出断言中的句子 $\\psi$ 和可证等价式。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,g,d,T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vartheta","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Code}^{(1)}_S,\\operatorname{CodeSent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fix}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Code}^{(1)}_S\\coloneqq g[\\mathrm{Fml}^{(1)}_S[\\langle v\\rangle]],\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CodeSent}_S\\coloneqq g[\\mathrm{Sent}_S].","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathrm{Fix}_S\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\ \\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\Bigl[\n&(e\\notin\\operatorname{Code}^{(1)}_S\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Fix}_S(e)=0)\\\\\n&\\land\\Bigl(e\\in\\operatorname{Code}^{(1)}_S\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Fix}_S(e)\\in\\operatorname{CodeSent}_S\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\exists\\phi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{(1)}_S\\ \\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\\n[e=g(\\phi)\\land\\mathrm{Fix}_S(e)=g(\\psi)\\\\\n&\\hspace{18em}\\land T\\vdash(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\phi[\\overline{\\mathrm{Fix}_S(e)}/v])]\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi(v)","display":false},{"tex":"e=g(\\phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_\\phi(v)","display":false},{"tex":"b_e=g(\\delta_\\phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fix}_S(e)=\\mathrm{Sub}_S(b_e,b_e)","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fix}_S","display":false},{"tex":"T,g","display":false}],"bytes":2726,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-thm-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal.md]]\n[[90-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[90-thm-fixed-point-algorithm.md]]\n[[90-thm-kleene-second-recursion.md]]\n[[90-thm-min-closure-rec.md]]\n[[90-thm-myhill-operator.md]]\n[[90-thm-recursion-theorem.md]]\n[[90-thm-recursive-set-representation.md]]\n[[90-thm-second-incompleteness.md]]\n[[90-thm-smullyan-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-thm-tarski-undefinability.md]]"}],"outgoing":["00ee901093c12d44","adc0aa731119457e","7279c20158ac140e","137d75d038de4a47","b86b211a75cf1748","d53b945955293235","4ce2b2789d377e1f","714deb184f73887a","f57084ad3c1a7029","61d70aa13427c3b5","b7d96c072a4c677f"]}